WEBVTT

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:03.980
Here in the Dark Realm,
where strength reigns supreme,

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:09.300
only those with true power
deserve to sit upon the throne.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.900
That means you<i> don't belong there!</i>

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:18.120
You're unworthy of being second-in-command!

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:21.580
I'm the real number 2 around here!

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.050
The time has come...

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:34.570
for me, the Magnificent Saurva, to defeat
Jahy and rule over the Dark Realm!

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:16.360
I tried to challenge Jahy for the title
of the Dark Realm's second-in-command

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.410
time...

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:24.030
and time...

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.670
and time again.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:36.160
Every time, misfortune spelled my defeat.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:44.860
The true power to rule the Dark Realm
is intellect, and I'm smarter than her.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:47.690
Clearly I, the Magnificent Saurva,
elite of the Dark Realm,

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:50.270
deserve to be second-in-command!

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:54.290
The collapse of the Dark Realm and our
fall to the human world were unexpected,

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:56.280
but this is my chance!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:03:00.850
If I defeat Jahy, take her mana
crystal, and restore the Dark Realm,

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.280
I shall be its true ruler!

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:11.630
I'm prepared so I may
defeat her at any moment.

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:13.090
I've overlooked nothing!

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.150
All that remains is to find Jahy.

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:20.230
Now, where are you?

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:22.430
Hmm? A mana crystal reaction...

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:28.350
J-J-J-Jahy?!

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.430
I found her already?

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.150
This is the perfect opportunity!

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:36.910
I'll take her down with one blow from behind.

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:42.360
Oh? You must be pretty keen
to track me down.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:45.320
You want to play that badly?

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.870
She noticed me?!

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:50.040
Fine, I'll reward you.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.480
She noticed me and she's still that calm?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.360
That's the second-in-command for you!

00:03:56.950 --> 00:04:00.290
So she's retained her powers
even in the human world?

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.940
There, there, there.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:05.300
I've seen you many times in my smaller form,

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.680
but it's the first we've met like this!

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.730
Be not afraid, Saurva!

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:13.560
You created the ultimate weapon for this day!

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.560
It took three months' worth
of my magic power to make it...

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:20.060
My magic amplifying potion!

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:24.740
When I drink this,
my power increases thirty-fold!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:28.860
I'll be able to take out even the
Dark Realm's second-in-command in one hit.

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:29.740
Hmph.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.680
You underestimated me, Jahy.

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:34.750
Today will be your doom!

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.390
Whoops, I'd better get going.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:40.670
See ya.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.150
Huh?

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.300
Hey, wai—

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.170
Ahhh!

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:56.020
Three months of hard work!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.980
I found her so soon and everything...

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.060
I can't just go home now.

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:05.320
D-Do I lick it up?

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.530
But that's...

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.910
It's humiliating!

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:10.840
Nevertheless...

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:12.120
Nevertheless!

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:15.120
I don't have time to think!

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:19.080
I'll do anything to defeat Jahy!

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:21.360
I have to lick it up...

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.260
or... I'll never defeat her...

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:35.520
Huh?!

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:37.370
D-Dog!

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.810
What're you doing?!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.390
Hey, you! Don't lick that!

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:42.730
I-I-I'm telling you to stop!

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.710
Don't do it! No!

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.280
So be it...

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.120
Stupid mutt!

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.760
Go and fetch the girl with the black braid—

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:14.710
S-Stop!

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:18.030
You're supposed to attack Jahy, not me!

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:26.960
Wh-Why is this happening to me?!

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:28.060
What the hell is that?!

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:31.070
A cosplayer is being attacked by a giant dog!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.570
We'll save you!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.440
That's a <i>dog</i>?! Isn't it kinda big?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:40.370
Around midday, a girl was attacked
by a giant dog in a residential area.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:43.610
Thanks to the local youth group,
it was captured without incident.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:47.840
Police rushed to the scene to investigate...

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.220
Wow, that's right around here.

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:47.840
That's unsettling.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.800
I feel like I've seen that dog before.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:55.220
Really? You need to be careful, Hy-chan.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:07:00.180
Ha! Dogs, cats... No animal
stands a chance against my moves.

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:01.520
Goodness me.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:15.580
It's done!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.290
My secret recipe,
the "transform into anything" drop!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.230
For some reason, she always
had a gaggle of underlings.

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.740
I don't doubt it's the same
here in the human world.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:27.390
That being the case...

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:31.540
I'll take this, turn into Jahy,
and commit blunder after blunder!

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:34.740
Lame.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:36.140
So uncool.

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.690
Jahy sucks now.

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:40.340
What a fall from grace.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:44.860
It will ruin her reputation
and leave her completely isolated!

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:44.860
Jaheek...

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:49.640
Just you wait, Jahy!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.210
How do you like that?!

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.130
I look just like Jahy!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.840
I'm a genius!

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:18.250
What's with this outfit?!

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:20.270
It's so breezy upstairs!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.280
And she walks around like this?

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.100
Is she some kind of pervert?!

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.500
Oh, it's you, Jah-ko.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.500
Rent's about due again.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.650
I hope you're prepared to pay.

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.610
Is this one of Jahy's associates?

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:36.680
Rent?

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.740
Perfect.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:41.750
This is just the thing
to ruin her reputation!

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:43.310
Rent?

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.710
I'll never pay!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:45.580
What?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:49.230
You scamp... You tryin'
to weasel out of it again?

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.130
Did she say "again"?

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:57.470
Does Jahy not pay her rent?

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.930
How can she be so evil?!

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:04.390
Eek, this person is ultra scary!

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:07.850
But I need to ruin Jahy's reputation!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:10.360
I can't let this scare me<i>!</i>

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:16.530
I h-have no money to give m-mere humans.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:27.610
You've got guts, don't ya?!

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.800
Please take this.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.740
Oh, what's this?

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.060
You're pretty obedient today.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.270
Yes, well...

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.220
I'm diggin' it.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:50.110
Hope you're as cooperative next month!

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:52.350
Yes, ma'am...

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:03.750
She was so terrifying
that I couldn't even resist.

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:07.520
But next time, I'm going to
do something so wretched and terrible

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:10.770
that it will ruin her reputation for sure!

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:14.870
Oh, Hy-chan! You're early today.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:19.000
Is this another of Jahy's associates?

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.050
I've got this one!

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:23.130
What's wrong, Hy-chan?

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:26.270
N-Nothing's wrong!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.450
Really?

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:31.440
Well, don't stand around out here.
Come inside already.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:33.630
Inside?

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:37.940
Ah, I see! Jahy must be a regular here.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.300
Armed with this knowledge,

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:43.230
I'll do something so bad that she'll
never be able to show her face again!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.700
How do you like that?!

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:49.310
What's the matter, Hy-chan?

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.830
I'll take a grape juice.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:54.930
Hmph! I sat on the table.

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:56.920
Next, I'll skip out on the tab.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:57.930
How'd you like that?!

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:59.760
Talk about trouble!

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.260
Oh you, Hy-chan.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.470
I-It didn't work?

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.600
Come now. Stop fooling around
and go get changed.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.860
Hey, missy, four draft beers over here!

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:14.150
You got room for five, missy?

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:16.810
Right away! Coming!

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:18.610
What the...?

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.970
Sorry for the wait.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:23.510
These seats free, missy?

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:25.580
Oh, yes! Help yourselves.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.870
Wh-Why do I have to...

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:31.460
This is too hard to eat, Mommy...

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:35.890
I brought you a kiddie dish, spoon, and fork.

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:37.550
Oh, thank you!

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:40.260
This seat's so hard on these old hips...

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:44.010
I'll see if we have another chair available!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.350
Sorry for the hassle.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:47.260
Here you go!

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:49.810
Oh, this is amazing!

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.980
I kinda did good...

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.740
Good work, Hy-chan.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.060
M-Ma'am...

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.920
Hy-chan, you really went
above and beyond tonight.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:13.270
You were very attentive
and our customers were really happy.

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:15.940
Oh, no, it was nothing...

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:17.710
Wait!

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:22.170
Oh, no! I'm helping<i> her reputation!</i>

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.200
It wasn't supposed to be like this.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:26.580
Why do I always...

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.640
What's wrong? Is something weighing on you?

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:31.770
Oh, um, no...

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:34.330
If there is, come talk to me.

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:36.230
I'll always be here to listen.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:39.420
What a nice person!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.000
Th-Thank you!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.700
I'll work even harder!

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:51.370
All right, there, there.
You can call it a night.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.560
Yes, ma'am...

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:57.020
Something was seriously
wrong with Hy-chan today.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:00.070
Something really bad must have happened.

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:06.760
She even gave me food to take home.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.080
She was so nice.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:12.060
I'd like to go see her again when
I'm back to my normal form.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.080
Wait!

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:14.990
Come to think of it,

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:18.860
if Jahy works there,
why didn't she show up tonight?

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:22.070
Don't tell me this was all part of her trap!

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.910
Did she sense I was coming, and...

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:28.030
Is she in cahoots with that thug, too?!

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:29.440
Damn you!

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:30.960
Jahy!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.500
I really can't underestimate her!

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.670
Meanwhile, the Great Jahy...

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.150
Huh?!

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:43.520
What time is it?!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:47.020
The boss is gonna ream me!

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:49.770
She'd totally overslept!

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:57.190
Remaining funds: 306 yen.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:00.930
Food stores: empty.

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.470
One week until payday.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.110
I'm screwed!

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:10.570
How am I supposed to live on 306 yen?

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:13.580
How did it come to this?

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:17.040
I had to cover the costs
to find that mana crystal

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.690
and to protect my honor.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.770
Then I treated myself as a reward.

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:25.750
Yay, since I found a mana crystal,
I'll splurge on some meat!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.580
All unavoidable expenses...

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:33.140
I didn't do anything wrong!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:36.060
The Great Jahy showed no sign of repentance.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:42.020
But at this rate, before I find more mana
crystals and restore the Dark Realm,

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:44.670
I, the Dark Realm's second-in-command, will...

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:46.940
starve to death in the human world!

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.000
Jaheek!

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.110
I won't stand for that!

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:54.570
But I can only stay in my normal
form for a limited amount of time,

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:58.380
and I can't pick up more shifts at work
since I need time to find mana crystals.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.580
What am I supposed to do?!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.090
I want to get money without working!

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:07.250
That's it.

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:10.050
I just need to get money without working...

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:11.020
Not yet!

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:12.550
I won't be defeated just yet!

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:16.260
There must be a way to get easy money!

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:19.210
Time for some intel gathering!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.800
Welcome!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.120
Special sale today!

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:26.460
Step right up!

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.320
Just try a sample!

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.340
It's cheap!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:33.880
As I suspected,
it's quite lively here at this hour.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:39.460
With this many people around,
surely there's a way...

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:42.580
Freshly fried croquettes!

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:44.320
How about it?

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.990
...to make easy money!

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.960
Thank you so much!

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:52.470
My precious 100 yen!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.930
Remaining funds: 206 yen!

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.830
Damn you, deli guy!

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.280
Here you go.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.830
Spreading those good smells all over!

00:15:58.280 --> 00:15:59.830
Thank you very much!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.900
Shit! It's delicious!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:08.070
Ugh, the shopping district
is a terrifying place.

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:12.500
I came looking for a way to make money,
and I ended up spending<i> money.</i>

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.590
Talk about mission failure!

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:20.610
Hey, lady! You there!

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:23.730
You know an easy way to make money?

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:27.180
Huh? If you've got one, tell me.

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:30.460
What? Man, you're useless.

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.630
So, what'll it be?

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:34.680
One tsukune skewer.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:35.840
Here you go!

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:43.730
Shit! How did this happen?!

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:47.750
It's delicious...

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:50.030
Remaining funds: 106 yen!

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:51.530
No, no, no!

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:57.110
I came here to turn my 306, my 206...
my 106 yen into more money!

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:02.020
I aim to restore the Dark Realm.

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:05.110
I will not be controlled by my desires!

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:08.420
Hey! You there!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:09.800
How do you make easy—

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.450
One meat bun, please.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:14.130
Coming right up! Just the one?

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.780
Hey, I was talking to you!

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:17.970
Sorry. Just a moment, little one.

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.640
How dare you?!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.880
I'm busy, so hurry it up!

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:22.980
Come again!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:23.680
Thanks.

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:29.480
Come again!

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:48.560
Goodbye...

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.280
100 yen!

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:57.860
That good, huh?

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:01.590
Six yen...

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:04.510
It's all over finally.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:08.560
I supposedly came here
to make money, to live...

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:12.630
If this is how it was going to turn out,
I never should have come!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:16.980
Am I fated to fade into obscurity
and die with this measly six yen?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:19.400
Damn it...

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:21.460
Damn it!

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:27.910
Welcohhme...

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:30.620
Here is your beer.

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:34.060
I didn't order any. And that's empty.

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:36.170
Hy-chan, you seem tired.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.180
Are you eating properly?

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:44.390
What?! You only have six yen?

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:47.970
You have to plan how to
spend your money, Hy-chan.

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:49.350
I know that!

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.100
This is all part of the plan.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:56.430
If I still had that 300 yen, I wouldn't
have to tell the boss about this.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:01.610
But six yen isn't worth anything, is it?

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:03.610
O-Of course it is!

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:06.790
Those who scoff at pocket change
will end up crying for pocket change!

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:10.940
You're right. Money is important.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:14.000
We can't waste even a single yen.

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.420
Of course.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.180
I d-didn't waste...

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:20.970
...any? That's not exactly true.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.640
How could I have been so foolish?!

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:28.060
If you had said something, I would
have let you have your salary early.

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.940
Y-You really mean it?

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:33.540
Yup. Just this once.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.710
My, my.

00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:50.340
The Great Jahy managed to scrape by somehow.

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:51.830
There, there.

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:24.800
Ten minutes until my deadline.

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.720
This is bad. Real bad.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.530
I need to finish drawing this no matter what!

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.010
Hey, aren't you done yet?!

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.360
I'm sorry! Not quite!

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:34.720
Tch! Damn worthless assistant!

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:37.990
Even if I needed the help,
I shouldn't have hired you.

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:45.680
I-I'm so very sorry!
I promise to be of more use!

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:51.280
Hello?

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:52.110
Yes.

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:55.120
Oh, Jahy-sensei is currently...

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.980
unfortunately not in.

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:04.040
You can say what you want,
but if she's not here, she's not here!

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:06.000
Who was that?

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:11.370
No idea. They had a very rude tone
and kept demanding that I put you on.

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:14.080
I assume it was some unimportant cold-caller.

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:15.640
Y-You don't say...

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:22.950
You got some guts,
pretendin' not to be home with me.

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.060
What's your problem?

00:22:25.060 --> 00:22:29.970
Stay back. She's out of your league.

00:22:29.970 --> 00:22:31.380
But...

00:22:31.380 --> 00:22:33.090
Five minutes left.

00:22:33.090 --> 00:22:36.290
You do know what'll happen
if you don't finish?

00:22:37.130 --> 00:22:38.860
Yes! You don't have to tell me!

00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:39.850
But I need at least—

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:40.850
Don't mess with me!

00:22:40.850 --> 00:22:43.250
Month after month, you make me
wait until the last second!

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:45.210
Finish drawin' already!

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:47.500
Impossible! Just impossible!

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:49.810
The creative process is delicate!

00:22:49.810 --> 00:22:53.980
You're dead wrong if you think an artist
can just pick up a pen and draw!

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:55.180
You punk.

00:22:56.950 --> 00:22:58.200
It'll be dropped.

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:02.250
<i>The Great Jahy Will Not Be Defeated!</i>
won't be featured this month.

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:06.020
If you don't want that, then draw. Now!

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:10.290
I finished my part over here!

00:23:10.290 --> 00:23:11.600
One more minute!

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:13.530
Shut up! Let me focus!

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:15.990
I just need to fine tune this...

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:18.710
Okay.

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:20.050
It's done!

00:23:20.050 --> 00:23:21.900
Good work!
